{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"AMO","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"阿摩司书","commonName":"阿摩司书","title":"阿摩司书","order":30,"numberOfChapters":9,"sha256":"aea65afe0e5862ee36486d1d8f71c20a1bc4c3aa5415828aa0c58b4c80057d03","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/AMO/1.json","lastChapterNumber":9,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/AMO/9.json","totalNumberOfVerses":146},"chapter":{"number":9,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["耶和华的审判"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"我看见主站在祭坛旁，祂说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“你要击打柱顶，使殿的根基震动；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要打碎它们，使殿宇坍塌压死众人。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"侥幸生还的，我要用刀剑杀掉，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"无人能逃脱，无人能幸免。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"即使他们挖洞钻进阴间，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我也要把他们揪出来；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"即使他们爬上高天，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我也要把他们拉下来；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"即使他们藏在迦密山的峰顶，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我也要去搜寻，捉住他们；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"即使他们潜到海底，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我也要派海蛇去吞咬他们；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"即使他们被敌人掳去，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我也要命刀剑追杀他们。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要定睛在他们身上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不是要赐福而是要降祸。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"主——万军之耶和华触摸大地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"大地就消融，地上的人都要哀号；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"大地如埃及的尼罗河涨起退落。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那位在天上建造楼阁，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在大地之上立定穹苍，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"召来海水浇在大地上的——","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂的名字是耶和华。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"耶和华说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“以色列人啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在我眼中，你们不是和古实人一样吗？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我不是领你们出埃及，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"领非利士人出迦斐托","poem":1},{"noteId":8},{"text":"，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"领亚兰人出吉珥吗？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"主耶和华的眼目察看这罪恶的国家，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要从地上除灭它，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但不会完全毁灭雅各家。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华说的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"“因为我要下令在万国中筛以色列家，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就像人筛谷物，一粒石子也不会落在地上。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在我的子民中，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所有夸口说‘灾祸不会追上我们，也不会迎面而来’的罪人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"都要死在刀下。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["以色列的复兴"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"text":"“到那日，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要重建大卫已倾覆的棚子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"修补它城墙的缺口。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要从废墟中重建它，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"恢复它往日的荣耀。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这样，以色列人必拥有以东所剩的和所有属于我名下的国家。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是要成就这事的耶和华说的。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“时候将到，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"五谷还未收完又该耕种了，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"葡萄还未踩完又该栽种了。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"甜酒从群山上滴下，在丘岭间流淌。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要使我被掳的以色列子民返乡，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们要重建废城并住在城中，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"栽种葡萄园，喝园中酿出的美酒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"整理园圃，吃园中出产的佳果。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要将以色列人栽种在他们自己的土地上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们永不再从我赐给他们的土地上被铲除。”","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是你们的上帝耶和华说的。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":8,"caller":"+","text":"“迦斐托”即克里特岛。","reference":{"chapter":9,"verse":7}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/AMO/9.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/OBA/1.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/AMO/8.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":15}